# BuildKit reads this beside redotcom/deploy/Dockerfile (context web/): the disc-derived and generated trees stay out,
# and of the landing site and the shared design system only the manifests npm ci needs go in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/public
**/test-fixtures
**/test-results
**/docs
.env
**/.env
redotcom/deploy
landing/*
!landing/package.json
shared/*
!shared/package.json
*.ZDB
*.ZAR
*.iso
